(31, 'kaniva-wet-food-skin-coat-5-fish', 'Kaniva Skin & Coat Wet Cat Food – 5 Fish', 'Kaniva Skin & Coat Wet Cat Food – 5 Fish is a tasty wet meal for adult cats. Serve it as a full meal or mix it with dry food to add flavour and moisture.', 'Kaniva Skin & Coat Wet Cat Food – 5 Fish is a tasty wet meal for adult cats. Serve it as a full meal or mix it with dry food to add flavour and moisture.
