## Match the life stage
Kittens need higher protein and DHA. Adult cats do well on a balanced grain free recipe.

## Read the first ingredient
Real meat should be first on the list, not corn or by-product meal.

## Mix wet and dry
Bangladesh''s heat means hydration matters. A wet pouch a day helps urinary health.', 'Buying Guide', 'Best Cat Food in Bangladesh — Buying Guide 2026', 'A practical guide to choosing the best cat food in Bangladesh by life stage, ingredients and budget.', 'best cat food in bangladesh, cat food bangladesh', datetime('now', '-3 days')),
('kitten-feeding-schedule', 'Kitten Feeding Schedule: Month by Month', 'A clear feeding chart for kittens from two months to one year.', 'Kittens grow fast and need frequent small meals.

## 2-4 months
Three to four meals a day of high protein kitten food.

## 4-9 months
Three meals a day, slowly increasing portion size.

## 9-12 months
Move to two meals a day and start transitioning to adult food.', 'Pet Tips', 'Kitten Feeding Schedule Month by Month — Kaniva Bangladesh', 'How much and how often to feed your kitten from two months to one year.', 'kitten food, kitten feeding schedule', datetime('now', '-2 days')),
('dry-vs-wet-cat-food', 'Dry vs Wet Cat Food: Which One Does Your Cat Need?', 'Both have a place. Here is how to balance them for a healthy cat.', 'Dry food is convenient and good for dental health. Wet food adds moisture that supports the urinary tract.

## The simple answer
Use dry food as the base and add a wet pouch several times a week.', 'Pet Tips', 'Dry vs Wet Cat Food — Kaniva Bangladesh', 'Compare dry and wet cat food and learn how to balance both for your cat.', 'dry cat food, wet cat food', datetime('now', '-1 days'));
